+| `r_h` | `lambda_h` | necessary `d_h` |
+|---:|---|---:|
+| 1 | `(4)` | `2gamma_h+3` |
+| 2 | `(3,1)` or `(2,2)` | `2gamma_h+4` |
+| 3 | `(2,1,1)` | `2gamma_h+5` |
+| 4 | `(1,1,1,1)` | `2gamma_h+6` |
+
+All rows are necessary only; none asserts existence or attainment.
+
+If the slice exhaustivity is instead left open, define
