+```text
+f=t^4,                    g=s/(4t^3)
+```
+
+has `{f,g}=1` and degree four, yet `C(t)` is a proper relative closure of
+`C(t^4)`.  The countercontrol fails the exact-ring hypothesis precisely
+because `t` is a unit.
